  "asclepius-the-physician": ["Asclepius a Physician", "Asclepius a Physician, whom Censorinus remembreth for curing the Frenzie by Musicke; not the Asclepius of the Dialogues of Pimander, nor Tosorthrus whom the Aegyptians called Asclepius.", "him"],
